  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : [{(49 × 12) - (6 ÷ 2)} + (4 - 3)] ÷ 5\n\n \n \n\n Given signs\n +\n -\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\n Means\n ÷\n +\n -\n ×\n \n \n\nSo, after interchanging the signs :\n\n⇒[{(__**49 - 12**__) + (__**6 × 2**__)} ÷ (__**4 + 3**__)] × 5\n\n⇒[{__**37**____** + 12**__} ÷ 7] × 5\n\n⇒[__**49**____** ÷ 7**__] × 5\n\n⇒__**7** ____× 5__\n\n⇒**35**\n\nHence, \"35\" is the correct answer.",
